    {
      "id": "6a80f777ec5b1ede9627e48b",
      "text": "M&A",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786836893,
      "updated": 1786836893
    },
    {
      "id": "6a80f79c0000000000132ed0",
      "text": "合併：Mergers",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786836893,
      "updated": 1786836901
    },
    {
      "id": "6a80f7a10000000000132ed2",
      "text": "買収：Acquisitions",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786836898,
      "updated": 1786836905
    },
    {
      "id": "6a80f79d0000000000132ed1",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786836893,
      "updated": 1786836893
    },
    {
      "id": "6a80f95b0000000000132ed5",
      "text": "[https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/M&A M&A - Wikipedia]",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786837339,
      "updated": 1786837341
    },
    {
      "id": "6a80f7aa0000000000132ed3",
      "text": " 企業・事業の全部または一部の[移転]を伴う取引の総称。",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786836907,
      "updated": 1786837448
    },
    {
      "id": "6a80f95f0000000000132ed7",
      "text": "  狭義には、会社の[支配権]の[移転]を伴う取引を指す。",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786837344,
      "updated": 1786837449
    },
    {
      "id": "6a80f9710000000000132ed8",
      "text": "  広義には、",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786837361,
      "updated": 1786837370
    },
    {
      "id": "6a80f9790000000000132ed9",
      "text": "  \t[支配権]50%未満の取得に留まる[マイノリティ出資]、",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786837370,
      "updated": 1786837462
    },
    {
      "id": "6a80f97d0000000000132eda",
      "text": "  \t既存[子会社]の[完全子会社]化、",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786837374,
      "updated": 1786837438
    },
    {
      "id": "6a80f98e0000000000132edc",
      "text": "  \tこれらのような、[支配権]を強化する取引も含まれる。",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786837390,
      "updated": 1786837466
    },
    {
      "id": "6a80fa290000000000132ee1",
      "text": " 企業買収・バイアウト",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786837545,
      "updated": 1786837597
    },
    {
      "id": "6a80fa460000000000132ee2",
      "text": " \t過半数株式の買い取りによる企業とその支配権の獲得",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786837574,
      "updated": 1786837597
    },
    {
      "id": "6a80fa5f0000000000132ee3",
      "text": " \tM&A 合併、業務移管、統合を含み、バイアウトは買い取りを意味する",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786837599,
      "updated": 1786837624
    },
    {
      "id": "6a80fa080000000000132ee0",
